{"title": "Death Burst", "pageid": 6171, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Death_Burst", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>\n<b>Death Burst</b> is a family of abilities available to <a href=\"/wiki/Mephit\" title=\"Mephit\">mephits</a> that causes them to explode when they die. It has both a passive component that is triggered automatically on death and an active component that lets them manually trigger the explosion, typically dealing twice the damage. Death Burst is available in several different damage types depending on the type of mephit. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Fire\">Fire</span></h2>\n<p><b>Action</b>\n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-image nomobile\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Explosion.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/48/Generic_Explosion.webp/100px-Generic_Explosion.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/48/Generic_Explosion.webp/150px-Generic_Explosion.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/48/Generic_Explosion.webp/200px-Generic_Explosion.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/48/Generic_Explosion.webp/100px-Generic_Explosion.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/48/Generic_Explosion.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-header\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Death_Burst_(Fire)\" title=\"Death Burst (Fire)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/80px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Death Burst\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Death_Burst_(Fire)\" title=\"Death Burst (Fire)\">Death Burst</a></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-content\">\n<dl><div><div><b>Damage: 2~12</b></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:30px;height:30px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:0;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/96/D6_Fire.png/27px-D6_Fire.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/96/D6_Fire.png/40px-D6_Fire.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/96/D6_Fire.png/54px-D6_Fire.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/96/D6_Fire.png/27px-D6_Fire.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/96/D6_Fire.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">2d6</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a></div></div></div></div></dl> Explode in a burst of fire.\n</div> \n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-footer\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-horizontlist\"> \n<dl><dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"DEX Save\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">DEX</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</dd></dl>\n    </div></div>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<p><b>Passive</b>\n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-image nomobile\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Fire.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/43/Generic_Fire.webp/100px-Generic_Fire.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/43/Generic_Fire.webp/150px-Generic_Fire.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/43/Generic_Fire.webp/200px-Generic_Fire.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/43/Generic_Fire.webp/100px-Generic_Fire.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/43/Generic_Fire.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-header\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Death_Burst:_Fire\" title=\"Death Burst: Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Generic_Fire_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Fire_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Generic_Fire_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Fire_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Generic_Fire_Icon.webp/80px-Generic_Fire_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Death Burst: Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Generic_Fire_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Fire_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Generic_Fire_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Death_Burst:_Fire\" title=\"Death Burst: Fire\">Death Burst: Fire</a></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-content\">\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n<p>When the mephit dies, it explodes in a burst of lava that deals <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">2d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage to all creatures within 2 m (7 ft).\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\">\n<p>On a successful save, the creatures still take half damage.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div> \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>This version of Death Burst is available to <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Mephit\" title=\"Magma Mephit\">Magma Mephits</a>. Note that unlike the other versions, the actively triggered explosion does not deal extra damage.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Cold\">Cold</span></h2>\n<p><b>Action</b>\n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-image nomobile\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Death_Burst_Cold.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/Death_Burst_Cold.webp/100px-Death_Burst_Cold.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/Death_Burst_Cold.webp/150px-Death_Burst_Cold.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/Death_Burst_Cold.webp/200px-Death_Burst_Cold.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/Death_Burst_Cold.webp/100px-Death_Burst_Cold.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c5/Death_Burst_Cold.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-header\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Death_Burst_(Cold)\" title=\"Death Burst (Cold)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f8/Death_Burst_Cold_Icon.webp/40px-Death_Burst_Cold_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f8/Death_Burst_Cold_Icon.webp/60px-Death_Burst_Cold_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f8/Death_Burst_Cold_Icon.webp/80px-Death_Burst_Cold_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Death Burst\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f8/Death_Burst_Cold_Icon.webp/40px-Death_Burst_Cold_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f8/Death_Burst_Cold_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Death_Burst_(Cold)\" title=\"Death Burst (Cold)\">Death Burst</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-content\">\n<dl><div><div><b>Damage: 4~24</b></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:30px;height:30px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:0;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/D6_Cold.png/27px-D6_Cold.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/67/D6_Cold.png/40px-D6_Cold.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/67/D6_Cold.png/54px-D6_Cold.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/D6_Cold.png/27px-D6_Cold.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/67/D6_Cold.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">4d6</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/29px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/39px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">Cold</span></a></div></div></div></div></dl> Explode in a burst of ice that damages all nearby creatures.\n</div> \n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-footer\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-horizontlist\"> \n<dl><dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"DEX Save\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">DEX</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</dd></dl>\n    </div></div>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<p><b>Passive</b>\n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-image nomobile\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Cold.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Generic_Cold.webp/100px-Generic_Cold.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Generic_Cold.webp/150px-Generic_Cold.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Generic_Cold.webp/200px-Generic_Cold.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Generic_Cold.webp/100px-Generic_Cold.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7c/Generic_Cold.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-header\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Death_Burst:_Cold\" title=\"Death Burst: Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Generic_Cold_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Cold_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Generic_Cold_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Cold_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Generic_Cold_Icon.webp/80px-Generic_Cold_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Death Burst: Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Generic_Cold_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Cold_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2b/Generic_Cold_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Death_Burst:_Cold\" title=\"Death Burst: Cold\">Death Burst: Cold</a></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-content\">\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n<p>When the mephit dies, it explodes in a burst of ice that deals <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">2d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/29px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/39px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">Cold</span></a> damage to all creatures within 2 m (7 ft).\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\">\n<p>On a successful save, the creatures still take half damage.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div> \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>This version of Death Burst is available to <a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Mephit\" title=\"Ice Mephit\">Ice Mephits</a>, including those summoned with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Minor_Elemental:_Ice_Mephits\" title=\"Conjure Minor Elemental: Ice Mephits\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Ice_Mephits_Icon.webp/25px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Ice_Mephits_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Ice_Mephits_Icon.webp/38px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Ice_Mephits_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Ice_Mephits_Icon.webp/50px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Ice_Mephits_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Conjure Minor Elemental: Ice Mephits\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Ice_Mephits_Icon.webp/25px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Ice_Mephits_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c2/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Ice_Mephits_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Minor_Elemental:_Ice_Mephits\" title=\"Conjure Minor Elemental: Ice Mephits\">Conjure Minor Elemental: Ice Mephits</a>. The explosion also creates an <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_(surface)\" title=\"Ice (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Ice_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Ice_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Ice_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Ice_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Ice_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Ice_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ice\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Ice_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Ice_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/89/Ice_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ice_(surface)\" title=\"Ice (surface)\">Ice</a> surface in the area of effect that can potentially trip anyone caught inside.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Force\">Force</span></h2>\n<p><b>Action</b>\n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-image nomobile\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Death_Burst_Mud.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Death_Burst_Mud.webp/100px-Death_Burst_Mud.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Death_Burst_Mud.webp/150px-Death_Burst_Mud.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Death_Burst_Mud.webp/200px-Death_Burst_Mud.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Death_Burst_Mud.webp/100px-Death_Burst_Mud.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Death_Burst_Mud.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-header\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Death_Burst_(Mud)\" title=\"Death Burst (Mud)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Death_Burst_Mud_Icon.webp/40px-Death_Burst_Mud_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Death_Burst_Mud_Icon.webp/60px-Death_Burst_Mud_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Death_Burst_Mud_Icon.webp/80px-Death_Burst_Mud_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Death Burst\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Death_Burst_Mud_Icon.webp/40px-Death_Burst_Mud_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/Death_Burst_Mud_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Death_Burst_(Mud)\" title=\"Death Burst (Mud)\">Death Burst</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-content\">\n<dl><div><div><b>Damage: 6~36</b></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:42px;height:30px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:9px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:1;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/D6_Force.png/27px-D6_Force.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/D6_Force.png/40px-D6_Force.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/D6_Force.png/54px-D6_Force.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/D6_Force.png/27px-D6_Force.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/D6_Force.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><span style=\"z-index:0;position:absolute;transform:translate( 40%, -30%) rotate(20deg)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/D6_Force.png/27px-D6_Force.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/D6_Force.png/40px-D6_Force.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/D6_Force.png/54px-D6_Force.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/D6_Force.png/27px-D6_Force.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/D6_Force.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">4d6</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span></a></div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"> + <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">2d6</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span></a></div></div></div></div></dl> Explode in a burst of sticky mud. It dries instantly on any nearby creatures not made of mud, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Muddy_(Condition)\" title=\"Muddy (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/23/Muddy_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Muddy_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/23/Muddy_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Muddy_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/23/Muddy_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Muddy_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Restraining\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/23/Muddy_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Muddy_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/23/Muddy_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>&nbsp;<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Muddy_(Condition)\" title=\"Muddy (Condition)\">Restraining</a></span></span> and hurting them.\n</div> \n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-footer\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-horizontlist\"> \n<dl><dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"DEX Save\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">DEX</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</dd></dl>\n    </div></div>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<p><b>Passive</b>\n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-image nomobile\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Force.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/82/Generic_Force.webp/100px-Generic_Force.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/82/Generic_Force.webp/150px-Generic_Force.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/82/Generic_Force.webp/200px-Generic_Force.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/82/Generic_Force.webp/100px-Generic_Force.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/82/Generic_Force.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-header\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Death_Burst:_Force\" title=\"Death Burst: Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Generic_Force_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Force_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Generic_Force_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Force_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Generic_Force_Icon.webp/80px-Generic_Force_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Death Burst: Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Generic_Force_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Force_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Generic_Force_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Death_Burst:_Force\" title=\"Death Burst: Force\">Death Burst: Force</a></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-content\">\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n<p>When the mephit dies, it explodes with a force that deals <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">2d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span></a> damage to all creatures within 2 m (7 ft).\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\">\n<p>On a successful save, the creatures still take half damage.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div> \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>This version of Death Burst is available to <a href=\"/wiki/Ancient_Mud_Mephit\" title=\"Ancient Mud Mephit\">Ancient</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Young_Mud_Mephit\" title=\"Young Mud Mephit\">Young Mud Mephits</a>. This includes the ones summoned by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Minor_Elemental:_Mud_Mephits\" title=\"Conjure Minor Elemental: Mud Mephits\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Mud_Mephits_Icon.webp/25px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Mud_Mephits_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Mud_Mephits_Icon.webp/38px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Mud_Mephits_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Mud_Mephits_Icon.webp/50px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Mud_Mephits_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Conjure Minor Elemental: Mud Mephits\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Mud_Mephits_Icon.webp/25px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Mud_Mephits_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Mud_Mephits_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Minor_Elemental:_Mud_Mephits\" title=\"Conjure Minor Elemental: Mud Mephits\">Conjure Minor Elemental: Mud Mephits</a>. The explosion also creates a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mud\" title=\"Mud\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Mud_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Mud_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Mud_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Mud_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Mud_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Mud_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mud\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Mud_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Mud_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/92/Mud_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mud\" title=\"Mud\">Mud</a> surface in the area of effect that impedes movement.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202141\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.122 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.133 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5360/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 99573/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 33659/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 24/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.028/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1407461/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  107.073      1 -total\n 61.64%   65.999      3 Template:Feature_box\n 57.38%   61.434      6 Template:Feature_box/format\n 39.48%   42.273     72 Template:Trim\n 29.52%   31.603      6 Template:Tooltip_box\n 28.92%   30.964     19 Template:Icon_text\n 24.50%   26.238      6 Template:Damage_display\n 22.67%   24.270     13 Template:Icon_link\n 21.56%   23.081      3 Template:Passive_box\n 12.85%   13.760     12 Template:Template_style\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:6171-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202141 and revision id 240312. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}